  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>html_css - reads landingpage.html three times with the HTML Parser and CSS selectors: product names,
prices and the About Us text.

1. gr-one-row: Generate Rows, limit 1, one field page (String) = landingpage.html.
2. html-products: HTML Parser, Source File ${Internal.Entry.Current.Directory}/../landingpage.html, CSS
   Selector .product h3, Result Field name product_names.
3. html-prices: HTML Parser, the same file, CSS Selector .product .price, Result Field name prices.
4. html-about: HTML Parser, the same file, CSS Selector #about p, Result Field name about_text.
5. sv-css: Select values, keeps page, product_names, prices, about_text.
6. txt-css: Text file output, fields from Get Fields with Minimal width, writes landingpage_css.csv beside this
   file.

Needs the Pentaho GenAI plugins and a license with GenAI (GENAI-EE) rights.
Shipped data: 1 row.</note>
      <xloc>160</xloc>
      <yloc>32</yloc>
      <width>627</width>
      <heigth>260</heigth>
      <fontname>Segoe UI</fontname>
      <fontsize>10</fontsize>
      <fontbold>N</fontbold>
      <fontitalic>N</fontitalic>
      <fontcolorred>0</fontcolorred>
      <fontcolorgreen>0</fontcolorgreen>
      <fontcolorblue>0</fontcolorblue>
      <backgroundcolorred>167</backgroundcolorred>
      <backgroundcolorgreen>224</backgroundcolorgreen>
      <backgroundcolorblue>245</backgroundcolorblue>
      <bordercolorred>100</bordercolorred>
      <bordercolorgreen>100</bordercolorgreen>
      <bordercolorblue>100</bordercolorblue>
      <drawshadow>Y</drawshadow>
    </notepad>
  </notepads>
